# Private financial data — never upload the source Monefy export or the pre-OPFS DB snapshot.
# /data/ is already in .gitignore, and the Vercel CLI falls back to .gitignore when this file is
# absent — but "falls back to" is not a guarantee worth betting a real ledger on, and this repo is
# deployed by direct CLI upload (there is no git remote), so the files on disk ARE the upload.
# Stated explicitly here so the exclusion does not depend on CLI default behaviour.
/data/

# Nothing below is needed to build or serve; keeping the upload small also keeps it boring.
/docs/
/.impeccable/
/.playwright-mcp/

# Scratch screenshots live in the repo ROOT only. This was briefly a bare `*.png`, which also
# swallowed public/icon-192.png and public/icon-512.png — the deploy came up with a manifest
# pointing at two 404s and a PWA that would not install. Anchored to the root so it can only ever
# match the throwaways it was written for.
/*.png
